# `KEYWORD-RENAME-SCOPE`: the same file, with each spelling written in the WRONG section. Both
# lines are errors, and each names the version its own section declared — the
# 0.1 section may not borrow section 2's vocabulary, and the 0.2 section does
# not accept the retired one. Per-section, not per-file, in both directions.
figdown 0.1 flowchart
process a "Step"
process b "Step 2"
flowline a -> b

figdown 0.2 flowchart
process c "Step"
process d "Step 2"
edge c -> d
